sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Shopper
  participant W as Widget (theme)
  participant P as Shopify App Proxy
  participant A as App server
  participant C as Catalog cache / Admin API
  participant D as Rules (SQLite)

  S->>W: open home, product or cart page
  W->>W: show last result for this cart (sessionStorage)
  W->>P: GET /apps/ai/recommend?skus=cart SKUs
  P->>A: signed request with shop
  A->>C: product keys, prices, images (cached 10 min)
  A->>D: active rules (cached 30 s)
  A->>A: combined rules first (A + B to C)
  A->>A: per-item rules, quota by cart size (5 / 3 / 2 / 1)
  A->>A: fill up: same category, recent orders, best sellers
  A->>A: merchant priority (balanced, revenue, quantity)
  A-->>P: JSON products
  P-->>W: JSON products
  W->>W: keep 1-2 earlier suggestions, render cards
  S->>W: Add to cart / Add all
  W->>W: POST /cart/add.js, CartLinesUpdateEvent
  Note over W: cart drawer updates, widget refreshes
